        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Overwatch, Inside, Doom, Dark Souls III, The Last Guardian, Dishonored 2, Titanfall 2, Doom 3\n- Concepts: 2016 in video gaming, game awards, franchise reboots, main series installments\n\nFacts:\n- In 2004, Doom 3 was released as the previous major installment in the Doom series before Doom (2016).\n- Doom (2016) is a reboot of the Doom franchise.\n- Doom (2016) is the fourth title in the main Doom series.\n- In 2016, many video game awards went to Overwatch, Inside, Doom, Dark Souls III, The Last Guardian, Dishonored 2, and Titanfall 2.",
